{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>荷里活女星Hayden Panettiere今年8月驚傳猝逝，享年36歲，死因與藥物使用過量有關。如今事隔約3個月，當時發生悲劇的Airbnb民宿房間悄悄重新開放訂房，甚至有房客入住後才得知，自己住進的竟是海蒂生前離世的房間，消息曝光引發討論。</p><p>根據美媒「TMZ」報導，Hayden Panettiere離世前，曾與男友一同入住這間Airbnb民宿，沒想到隔天早上，男友發現她已失去呼吸與心跳，雖然立即進行急救，仍無法挽回她的生命。Hayden最終因藥物使用過量離世，得年36歲。</p><figure><img alt=\"Hayden Panettiere藥物過量猝逝3個月後，出事的Airbnb民宿房間開啟訂房，有房客入住後才得知住的是命案房。（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166323816603979776154723.jpeg/1jj7SuyU4EfujF1AtGloIiYknQgJot6T7SkU_O0pFPw\"/><figcaption>Hayden Panettiere藥物過量猝逝3個月後，出事的Airbnb民宿房間開啟訂房，有房客入住後才得知住的是命案房。（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）</figcaption></figure><p>事發後，這間發生悲劇的民宿房間一度暫停出租，經過約3個月，如今已低調重新開放預訂。報導指出，有房客入住後才得知房間曾發生死亡事件，不過對方表示，房間清潔狀況良好，實際入住體驗也相當愉快。</p><figure><img alt=\"延伸閱讀：奪命狂呼女星Hayden Panettiere疑死於用藥過量　急救現場錄音曝（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166323809494503424562984.jpeg/U1J8-qXyUz-ZSO5noiUA3Cd9GPCluk6NO5TxTzuU8U8\"/><figcaption>延伸閱讀：奪命狂呼女星Hayden Panettiere疑死於用藥過量　急救現場錄音曝（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《英雄》（Heroes）中出演「啦啦隊長」克萊兒荷里活女星Hayden Panettiere，於當地時間8月16日驚傳在南卡羅來納州住宅內猝逝，享年 36 歲。（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166323440978759680065128.jpeg/PVsXr5qecYALAKrRoQBpoukWKVsu-WSmTULH6E1Cx-g\"/><figcaption>《英雄》（Heroes）中出演「啦啦隊長」克萊兒荷里活女星Hayden Panettiere，於當地時間8月16日驚傳在南卡羅來納州住宅內猝逝，享年 36 歲。（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"急救錄音檔案與最新調查隨之曝光，現場甚至發現用於逆轉鴉片類藥物過量的解毒噴劑。（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166323811923136512653471.jpeg/zLKTZQPho4Ve4fP0PEy9zCaCf8kFghyLrFg1vKxYNbw\"/><figcaption>急救錄音檔案與最新調查隨之曝光，現場甚至發現用於逆轉鴉片類藥物過量的解毒噴劑。（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166323814418878464718935.jpeg/YoI8IJLlNMLbsuYTgtDVH3E6ZwWiL5IjP1I5az9SOWs\"/><figcaption>Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166323816646184960402185.jpeg/A8pNZ0mNUodES4quxlNOEBivHZRkO0fRB20TOQdtEzk\"/><figcaption>Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166323818793799680854921.jpeg/1BZAAqddXEzeR9mriqEUZCCy1atBCklFlsyMepbMjHo\"/><figcaption>Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166323814515085312649728.jpeg/3N8yxgRu2ocnfwzgHSccv_MWoDRPm47mA0QoXgNEKF4\"/><figcaption>Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166323818789343232359428.jpeg/DC28q1uq342-TsA5m8FXkOHmH7Uz077XO68bSzuvG0s\"/><figcaption>Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166323820811128832352870.jpeg/SUa4jRTddxvVkCPE28yxquNJ2J55SMWXud4cUrneHFI\"/><figcaption>Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166323823025852416567293.jpeg/OcoC0ziBW2icLRo8KLI9kY0_N9x86zAuB3GNrgdxja4\"/><figcaption>Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166323820949147648846371.jpeg/3PvOlJeJtZadkuEjFT9HwoRNSlNQdGAJDNaTMwzWkzM\"/><figcaption>Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166323823197425664739124.jpeg/HjIYUsqAzEG--gzgVQz8az5xYshSz3YKtESnZ7REp2c\"/><figcaption>Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166323825370206208703961.jpeg/QYHyL7rXf2VDtNaR4HEFmTafiBAJbv5JXZTtY12U7WM\"/><figcaption>Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166323827572346880603549.jpeg/IhP0LyQ42ttz_yvOSw6Aa3befthUtdYABX5H2wV-R9s\"/><figcaption>Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166323829908705280305912.jpeg/WzmRhkL4yXGpC-EJB1xkyoXJ0zwUcUUla_rpKmv66So\"/><figcaption>Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166323757879398400203614.jpeg/Lo_Qz2cx2Pp-OmlTy4Ws9a3btyKRxlqVRFNjGERTYxg\"/><figcaption>Hayden Panettiere（Instagram@haydenpanettiere）</figcaption></figure><p>相隔14年！安潔莉娜裘莉重返坎城 性感露肩禮服展女神一貫靜奢風</p><p>「誇張圍兜兜」招蜂引蝶！艾瑪史東坎城遇「蟲蟲危機」嚇到花容失色秒閃退</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T09:14:56.315541+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1357,"images":17,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T09:00:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T09:48:47.389003+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T09:08:20.423741+00:00","content_hash":"3d82f29838a38d0cb32018a326936dd4ca15e9bcf7aaed400091e319c5cd7ed4","evidence_status":"full",